<http://www.spektrix.com/factorytheatre/event/149602ATPTBLMTGSCGVGJMVLJTNVKBVLL> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Dante’s Inferno: A Fusion of Text, Music and Thought";
  schema:description """
	Dante’s words meet live music and contemporary reflection in <span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Dante’s Inferno: A Fusion of Text, Music and Thought</span></span>, a DopoLavoro Teatrale creation commissioned by the Stratford Festival.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>At the heart of the performance is the universal journey told in the Divine Comedy: a man who has lost his way, his passage through Hell and the search for a possible path through the darkness.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Daniele Bartolini brings Dante’s verses to the stage, while Professor Donato Santeramo’s narration guides the audience through the work, shedding light on meanings, references and questions that remain profoundly contemporary. Andrea Gozzi’s live music creates an immersive soundscape around the words, placing the audience “nel mezzo” of a forest of sounds.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Theatre, literature and music come together in a unique artistic-pedagogical combination that spans the centuries and brings Dante into the present, making his descent into Hell a reflection on the anxieties, contradictions and search for meaning of our time.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Duration: approx. 95 mins<span><br/></span>Age Recommendation: 12+<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Seating for this event is limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis. We encourage guests to arrive early.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Maximum of two tickets per registrant/email address.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Please note that once the performance has begun, late arrivals will be seated discreetly, subject to availability and only where entry can be accommodated without disrupting the performance.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-27T20:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/factorytheatre/files/22428855-555d-4fd5-aae5-0287e0015cfb.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/factorytheatre/location/1AHGJDSMMPLMPPGNLJBQVLBRSKVDLQRPP>;
  schema:offers _:1ffe682b6d774e17985871fde78009e7284;
  schema:duration "PT95M";
  schema:endDate "2026-10-27T21:35:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

_:1ffe682b6d774e17985871fde78009e7284 a schema:AggregateOffer;
